# The gong forms and the kotekan's styles: GILAK (8 beats, nyog cag, the lanang in), LADRANG (32, Java's
# pelog); then each form and each style played a while, nothing clipping; and the boot screen
splash splash.png
wait 300
turn PRESET 4
wait 200
expect p0 5
expect cyclelen 8
tap SEQ
tapkey w0
wait 4000
tapkey w3
wait 4000
expect playing 1
shot gilak.png
wav gilak.wav
wait 8000
wavstop
expect clips 0
tap SEQ
wait 6000
turn PRESET 1
wait 200
expect p0 6
expect cyclelen 32
tap SEQ
tapkey w2
wait 6000
shot ladrang.png
expect clips 0
tap SEQ
wait 6000
# each style over each form, the kotekan in (SEMAR PEGULINGAN)
turn PRESET -5
wait 200
expect p0 1
turn K2 20
tap SEQ
tapkey w4
set form 2
set style 1
wait 3000
expect cyclelen 16
set style 2
wait 3000
set form 3
set style 3
wait 3000
set style 0
set form 4
wait 3000
expect cyclelen 32
set form 0
wait 3000
expect cyclelen 16
expect clips 0
expect playing 1
